WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.072 --> 00:00:06.014
Zann stood at the top of the waterfall.

2
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.882
Mist rose from a deep, sparkling pool far below.

3
00:00:33.902 --> 00:00:38.083
"You're not scared, are you?"

4
00:00:38.604 --> 00:00:40.184
a teasing voice said behind him.

5
00:00:44.006 --> 00:00:45.287
It was his friend, Perda.

6
00:00:46.147 --> 00:00:51.229
She smiled at him, and Zann noticed that the mist made her look even prettier than usual.

7
00:00:51.249 --> 00:00:55.331
"I'm not scared," he said with a laugh.

8
00:00:55.351 --> 00:00:56.812
"Here I go!"

9
00:00:59.232 --> 00:01:00.793
He leaped off the edge of the cliff.

10
00:01:01.553 --> 00:01:05.594
A second later he heard Perda yell, "Look out below!"

11
00:01:06.774 --> 00:01:10.295
He glanced up and saw her falling along with the sparkling water.

12
00:01:10.315 --> 00:01:14.897
"Whee!" he shouted as they both hurtled toward the pool.

13
00:01:15.497 --> 00:01:20.859
At the last second, Zann snapped his fingers and used magic to slow himself down.

14
00:01:23.719 --> 00:01:25.320
He splashed into the pool gently.

15
00:01:27.228 --> 00:01:31.249
A moment later Perda splashed down beside him, spraying him with water.

16
00:01:32.309 --> 00:01:34.570
She hadn't slowed herself as much as he had.

17
00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:36.451
That was typical.

18
00:01:37.231 --> 00:01:38.171
She was pretty brave.

19
00:01:38.191 --> 00:01:42.032
"Here come Darb and Gliss," Perda said, pointing up.

20
00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:45.153
Their two friends were at the top of the cliff.

21
00:01:45.933 --> 00:01:48.034
They jumped together, holding hands.

22
00:01:48.794 --> 00:01:52.915
That was partly because Darb was a Void, which meant he couldn't do magic.

23
00:01:53.635 --> 00:01:56.656
He needed Gliss' magic to keep him from falling too fast.

24
00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:01.803
But it was also because Gliss and Darb held hands a lot lately.

25
00:02:02.544 --> 00:02:06.367
Zann thought it was nice that they were a couple now, but it also made him feel a

26
00:02:06.647 --> 00:02:07.688
little bit uncomfortable.

27
00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.210
Splash! They landed together nearby.

28
00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.252
"That was fun, wasn't it?"

29
00:02:13.652 --> 00:02:15.453
Darb said, swimming over to Zann.

30
00:02:15.473 --> 00:02:17.895
"Yeah," Zann agreed.

31
00:02:18.476 --> 00:02:22.178
Then he spotted a boy around their age hurrying toward the pool.

32
00:02:22.198 --> 00:02:24.220
"Look! Ello's back."

33
00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.401
Zann swam to the edge of the pool, with his friends following.

34
00:02:29.021 --> 00:02:34.083
Ello had stopped to look at a tiny creature with silvery wings that had landed on a rock

35
00:02:34.283 --> 00:02:35.263
at the edge of the pool.

36
00:02:36.443 --> 00:02:37.844
Darb climbed out of the water.

37
00:02:37.864 --> 00:02:39.584
"Is that a dragon?"

38
00:02:39.984 --> 00:02:40.484
he asked.

39
00:02:41.364 --> 00:02:44.185
He was very interested in animals of all kinds.

40
00:02:44.805 --> 00:02:48.426
Ello carefully picked up the tiny creature and handed it to Darb.

41
00:02:48.446 --> 00:02:49.987
"Isn't it cute?

42
00:02:50.447 --> 00:02:54.248
There were no dragons in Skellia, but there are several species here in Mistafar."

43
00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:59.922
Gliss climbed out of the pool for a better look, squeezing water out of her bright red hair.

44
00:03:00.842 --> 00:03:05.965
She and Zann were the only Reds in the group—their red hair was a sign that they had

45
00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:07.705
especially strong magic.

46
00:03:07.725 --> 00:03:10.807
"It's cute," she said.

47
00:03:10.827 --> 00:03:15.649
"And it's definitely much less scary than the gulpers from your old world!"

48
00:03:16.469 --> 00:03:17.729
Zann agreed with that.

49
00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:23.712
They'd first met Ello in Skellia, a world of rising seas and constant rain.

50
00:03:24.524 --> 00:03:30.169
The Skellian people had wanted to escape before all of their land disappeared beneath the waves.

51
00:03:31.169 --> 00:03:36.113
However, the only way to leave was through the vortex that connected all the known worlds.

52
00:03:36.914 --> 00:03:39.916
Reaching the vortex required going through a wormhole.

53
00:03:40.617 --> 00:03:45.821
But magic-eating sea creatures called gulpers ate the wormholes as fast as they appeared.

54
00:03:45.841 --> 00:03:50.805
"True. None of us miss the gulpers," Ello said with a shudder.

55
00:03:50.825 --> 00:03:53.247
"Do you miss anything about Skellia?"

56
00:03:53.687 --> 00:03:54.308
Darb asked.

57
00:03:54.964 --> 00:03:56.025
Ello looked thoughtful.

58
00:03:56.045 --> 00:03:58.386
"I liked sailing on the open sea.

59
00:03:59.106 --> 00:04:01.148
And it's hard getting used to a whole new place."

60
00:04:02.088 --> 00:04:02.628
He smiled.

61
00:04:02.648 --> 00:04:04.449
"But Mistafar is great!

62
00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:07.451
Everyone is grateful that you convinced Wyssa to move us here."

63
00:04:08.712 --> 00:04:12.154
Wyssa was a mysterious woman with strong magic powers.

64
00:04:12.854 --> 00:04:16.176
Zann and his friends had met her during some earlier adventures.

65
00:04:16.996 --> 00:04:18.937
She'd brought the Skellians to Mistafar.

66
00:04:19.638 --> 00:04:23.620
This was the first time Zann and the others had traveled from Magica to visit.

67
00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:27.361
Suddenly Zann noticed that Ello's hands were empty.

68
00:04:27.381 --> 00:04:31.222
"Hey, I thought you were bringing snacks," he said with a grin.

69
00:04:31.242 --> 00:04:36.704
"Oh! I almost forgot to tell you—it's time for Perda's birthday cake," Ello said.

70
00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:39.785
Perda's birthday was the reason for the visit.

71
00:04:40.345 --> 00:04:45.647
Back in Magica, Zann lived with his parents in First City, while the other three kids lived in

72
00:04:45.727 --> 00:04:47.888
his former hometown of Swamp Bottom.

73
00:04:48.448 --> 00:04:54.511
They were able to visit one another occasionally with the help of zap accelerators, magical devices that helped

74
00:04:54.531 --> 00:04:56.673
them to travel long distances quickly.

75
00:04:57.273 --> 00:05:02.596
But Zann still missed seeing his friends every day like he had when he lived in Swamp Bottom.

76
00:05:02.616 --> 00:05:07.419
"Great! Waterfall jumping made me hungry," Perda said.

77
00:05:07.439 --> 00:05:09.200
"Let's go and have cake!"

78
00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.321
They walked back to the Skellians' village.

79
00:05:13.422 --> 00:05:17.024
Zann's parents were in the main square, chatting with some other adults.

80
00:05:17.704 --> 00:05:22.468
A platter of small, beautifully decorated cakes was sitting on a wooden table.

81
00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:24.750
"Happy birthday, Perda!"

82
00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:25.951
Ello's mother said.

83
00:05:25.971 --> 00:05:28.133
"Help yourselves to cake, kids."

84
00:05:29.233 --> 00:05:31.215
Zann and his friends each took a cake.

85
00:05:31.956 --> 00:05:33.577
Then they sat down to eat.

86
00:05:34.218 --> 00:05:36.820
"I'm glad your parents brought you to visit us," Ello said.

87
00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:40.703
"Perda talked them into it since it's her birthday," Zann said.

88
00:05:40.723 --> 00:05:43.865
"They know she's interested in being an explorer someday."

89
00:05:44.486 --> 00:05:46.908
"Or maybe a researcher," Gliss said.

90
00:05:47.592 --> 00:05:51.455
"She's absolutely obsessed with the ancient history of Magica!"

91
00:05:51.475 --> 00:05:52.456
"You are?"

92
00:05:52.996 --> 00:05:55.077
Zann looked at Perda in surprise.

93
00:05:55.778 --> 00:06:00.301
The last time he'd spent time with her, she had been more interested in studying other worlds.

94
00:06:01.402 --> 00:06:03.463
Perda took a bite of cake and then nodded.

95
00:06:03.483 --> 00:06:05.885
"Yes, it's really interesting.

96
00:06:06.505 --> 00:06:09.587
But it's hard to find much information about the Old Times."

97
00:06:10.568 --> 00:06:11.489
Gliss shuddered.

98
00:06:11.509 --> 00:06:16.032
"That's probably because everyone wants to forget about the Old Times.

99
00:06:16.828 --> 00:06:20.510
My parents say it was a time of dark magic and danger."

100
00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:23.111
Perda licked frosting off her fingers.

101
00:06:23.131 --> 00:06:27.993
"There's even less information about the time before the Old Times," she said.

102
00:06:28.013 --> 00:06:33.315
"Hey, Zann, remind me to ask your parents if they have any books about that period."

103
00:06:33.335 --> 00:06:36.256
"Okay." Zann nodded.

104
00:06:36.957 --> 00:06:38.998
Just then his parents came toward them.

105
00:06:39.018 --> 00:06:42.879
"Finish your cake, kids," his mother, Asta, said.

106
00:06:42.899 --> 00:06:44.480
"It's time to go home."

107
00:06:45.492 --> 00:06:46.314
Zann sighed.

108
00:06:47.215 --> 00:06:49.800
He wasn't sure what to think about Perda's new interest.

109
00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:52.464
"It's so strange," he thought.

110
00:06:52.484 --> 00:06:55.550
"I hardly know anything about my friends anymore!"
